	"interface.interaction.you_know_it_gets_boring_in_here_sometimes_i_m": "你知道嗎，這裡有時挺無聊的……我想找點樂子。嗯，你有Mistletoe嗎？",
	"interface.interaction.oh_my_i_do": "天哪，我有！",
